      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: `div_ceil()` would do the rounding in one call, as binder does with `div_ceil(PAGE_SIZE)`:\n\n```\n        let total_num_process_pages \u003d total_num_range_pages.div_ceil(pages_per_process_page);\n```\n\nSince the comment above it changes anyway, could it get a blank line before it too?",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "bf0b454de922c159333f12bbabfc99b68bf29a84",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
