      "writtenOn": "2026-10-30T18:38:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `LRU_COUNT` update is gone, but it looks like this hunk still drops `self.remove_lru(\u0026range)` and reads `range.size()` before `set_purged()`. Neither changes anything (`remove_lru()` finds nothing after `pop_back()`, and `set_purged()` doesn\u0027t change the size), and a643c1800767 in android17-6.18 rewrites these same lines.\n\nCould only the `start` and `end` conversion stay, as discussed on PS15? Something like:\n\n```\n            let start \u003d range.pgstart(self) * crate::ASHMEM_RANGE_PAGE_SIZE;\n            let end \u003d (range.pgend(self) + 1) * crate::ASHMEM_RANGE_PAGE_SIZE;\n            range.set_purged(self);\n            self.remove_lru(\u0026range);\n            freed +\u003d range.size(self);\n```",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "bf0b454de922c159333f12bbabfc99b68bf29a84",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
